  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ng-alert-code-cs</b></p><a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-alert-code-cs\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-alert-code-cs</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">contraindication<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-contraindication\"> </a></td><td>Contraindication</td><td>A clinical contraindication relevant to a planned intervention, medication, immunization, or procedure.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">allergy-risk<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-allergy-risk\"> </a></td><td>Allergy risk</td><td>A known or suspected allergy or intolerance risk requiring attention.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">medication-interaction<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-medication-interaction\"> </a></td><td>Medication interaction</td><td>A possible clinically significant interaction involving one or more medications.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">duplicate-therapy<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-duplicate-therapy\"> </a></td><td>Duplicate therapy</td><td>Potentially duplicative medication or treatment has been identified.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">missed-dose<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-missed-dose\"> </a></td><td>Missed dose</td><td>A scheduled medication or immunization dose was not administered as expected.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">dose-due<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-dose-due\"> </a></td><td>Dose due</td><td>A scheduled medication or immunization dose is currently due.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">dose-overdue<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-dose-overdue\"> </a></td><td>Dose overdue</td><td>A scheduled medication or immunization dose is overdue.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">abnormal-result<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-abnormal-result\"> </a></td><td>Abnormal result</td><td>A clinical or diagnostic result is outside its expected or acceptable range.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">critical-result<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-critical-result\"> </a></td><td>Critical result</td><td>A critical clinical or diagnostic result requires urgent review or action.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">pending-result<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-pending-result\"> </a></td><td>Pending result</td><td>A clinically relevant diagnostic result is still pending.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">infection-risk<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-infection-risk\"> </a></td><td>Infection risk</td><td>An infection, exposure, or transmission risk requires attention or precautions.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">isolation-required<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-isolation-required\"> </a></td><td>Isolation required</td><td>The subject requires isolation or specific infection-prevention precautions.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">safeguarding-concern<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-safeguarding-concern\"> </a></td><td>Safeguarding concern</td><td>A safeguarding concern requires review or protective action.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">possible-duplicate-record<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-possible-duplicate-record\"> </a></td><td>Possible duplicate record</td><td>The subject may have more than one health record.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">identity-mismatch<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-identity-mismatch\"> </a></td><td>Identity mismatch</td><td>Demographic, biometric, or identifier information may not match the intended subject.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">data-quality-issue<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-data-quality-issue\"> </a></td><td>Data quality issue</td><td>A data-quality, completeness, consistency, or record-integrity issue requires review.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">consent-restriction<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-consent-restriction\"> </a></td><td>Consent restriction</td><td>A consent directive limits access, disclosure, or use of the subject's information.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">follow-up-required<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-follow-up-required\"> </a></td><td>Follow-up required</td><td>The subject requires clinical, public-health, or administrative follow-up.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">referral-required<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-referral-required\"> </a></td><td>Referral required</td><td>Referral to another provider, facility, service, or level of care is required.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">reporting-required<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-reporting-required\"> </a></td><td>Reporting required</td><td>A statutory, programmatic, or public-health report or notification must be submitted.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">urgent-review<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-urgent-review\"> </a></td><td>Urgent review</td><td>The subject's information or clinical status requires urgent review.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other<a name=\"ng-alert-code-cs-other\"> </a></td><td>Other</td><td>An alert type not represented by another code in this code system.</td></tr></table></div>"
